# What builddmg.py writes. The .app is compiled into dist/, staged for the
# image in _dmg_staging/ and converted through a writable image on the way to
# the volume icon; only the finished stellody.dmg is worth keeping, and that
# is a release artefact rather than a tracked file.
dist/
_dmg_staging/
stellody.dmg
_stellody_rw.dmg

# What build_flatpak.sh writes. The manifest, the launcher and the desktop
# entry are GENERATED from the script rather than committed, so the script
# stays the one place the packaging is stated; clean_flatpak.sh removes all
# of it.
.flatpak-build/
.flatpak-builder/
.flatpak-repo/
.flatpak-wheels/
.flatpak-vendor/
packaging/
stellody.flatpak
uk.codecrafter.Stellody.yml
installer/payload/
installer/stage/
*.spec

# Release notes for the pending version, drafted then folded into the release
NOTES.md

# Session snapshot written by /ox and by the oxygen panic protocol
.claude/resume.md
